values
  ('bc8f599e-1fb4-409a-8103-48198bd41541', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Kinematics and modeling', 'This module establishes kinematics and modeling as the course''s first working framework. It supplies the language and representations needed before the path advances to newtonian dynamics.', 0),
  ('c5597c85-8f9b-4d29-98a2-eabe383dac3c', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'bc8f599e-1fb4-409a-8103-48198bd41541', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Coordinates', 'Coordinates identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within kinematics and modeling. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before constraints because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('6b3fd7a4-f7a2-4529-b705-5ef8abe69735', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'bc8f599e-1fb4-409a-8103-48198bd41541', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Constraints', 'Constraints is a governing quantity in kinematics and modeling, linking local calculations to system-level behavior and offering a consistency check. After coordinates, constraints supplies what is needed to address dimensions.', 1),
  ('f5d9a104-54af-450a-953e-579a5efd9377', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'bc8f599e-1fb4-409a-8103-48198bd41541', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Dimensions', 'Dimensions identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within kinematics and modeling. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After constraints, dimensions supplies what is needed to address approximation.', 2),
  ('efec3194-0188-402c-8245-78d3214d6a5f', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'bc8f599e-1fb4-409a-8103-48198bd41541', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Approximation', 'Approximation makes difficult behavior in kinematics and modeling tractable while exposing the assumptions and accuracy limits used by later methods. After dimensions, approximation supplies what is needed to address phase space.', 3),
  ('d22467cd-987e-465a-b11a-4fecf73aad8b', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'bc8f599e-1fb4-409a-8103-48198bd41541', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Phase space', 'Phase space gives kinematics and modeling a reusable representation for organizing assumptions, variables, and relationships before analysis begins. As the final topic in this module, phase space carries the completed idea into newtonian dynamics.', 4),
  ('ce879ff3-f3bf-4e90-bdfd-fc2d264a5446', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Newtonian dynamics', 'This module builds directly on kinematics and modeling and develops newtonian dynamics. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for energy and momentum.', 1),
  ('e836541e-b949-4fb9-b132-c2ea1a89c33d', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ce879ff3-f3bf-4e90-bdfd-fc2d264a5446', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Forces', 'Forces is a governing quantity in newtonian dynamics, linking local calculations to system-level behavior and offering a consistency check. It appears before drag because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('77662a78-cce0-454d-bee8-712cb8fe35a5', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ce879ff3-f3bf-4e90-bdfd-fc2d264a5446', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Drag', 'Drag identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within newtonian dynamics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After forces, drag supplies what is needed to address nonlinear equations.', 1),
  ('59a18fee-2d7f-4c5a-a055-7ca58ea1d35a', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ce879ff3-f3bf-4e90-bdfd-fc2d264a5446', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Nonlinear equations', 'Nonlinear equations identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within newtonian dynamics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After drag, nonlinear equations supplies what is needed to address qualitative solutions.', 2),
  ('d9f329b3-3d00-424d-bccf-ca5616deace3', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ce879ff3-f3bf-4e90-bdfd-fc2d264a5446', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Qualitative solutions', 'Qualitative solutions identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within newtonian dynamics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, qualitative solutions carries the completed idea into energy and momentum.', 3),
  ('cbf08407-a4e7-4df4-876f-fa03be0827af', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Energy and momentum', 'This module builds directly on newtonian dynamics and develops energy and momentum. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for angular momentum and rigid rotation.', 2),
  ('53a27a79-1c58-472b-a677-fbcf85e607c4', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'cbf08407-a4e7-4df4-876f-fa03be0827af', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Work', 'Work identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within energy and momentum. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before conservative forces because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('c126e907-0879-480e-bd45-bb3a4ccae938', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'cbf08407-a4e7-4df4-876f-fa03be0827af', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Conservative forces', 'Conservative forces is a governing quantity in energy and momentum, linking local calculations to system-level behavior and offering a consistency check. After work, conservative forces supplies what is needed to address center of mass.', 1),
  ('17e098cd-40cc-42d4-b117-e472fef69b31', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'cbf08407-a4e7-4df4-876f-fa03be0827af', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Center of mass', 'Center of mass identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within energy and momentum. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After conservative forces, center of mass supplies what is needed to address collisions.', 2),
  ('8dcb3ed5-92dd-4761-85bc-6c38c3aa53b3', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'cbf08407-a4e7-4df4-876f-fa03be0827af', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Collisions', 'Collisions identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within energy and momentum. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, collisions carries the completed idea into angular momentum and rigid rotation.', 3),
  ('ea5fa12d-6c5c-4b43-8a76-a7e2e4621235', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Angular momentum and rigid rotation', 'This module builds directly on energy and momentum and develops angular momentum and rigid rotation. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for oscillations i.', 3),
  ('9f27f253-7130-4287-aadc-590a928400c2', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ea5fa12d-6c5c-4b43-8a76-a7e2e4621235', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Torque', 'Torque identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within angular momentum and rigid rotation. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before inertia tensor because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('c12d7798-fe6c-47de-b6d0-763e76f26f6e', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ea5fa12d-6c5c-4b43-8a76-a7e2e4621235', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Inertia tensor', 'Inertia tensor identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within angular momentum and rigid rotation. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After torque, inertia tensor supplies what is needed to address principal axes.', 1),
  ('6873a590-7290-4430-a85e-b5c9e79dc934', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'ea5fa12d-6c5c-4b43-8a76-a7e2e4621235', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Principal axes', 'Principal axes identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within angular momentum and rigid rotation. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, principal axes carries the completed idea into oscillations i.', 2),
  ('aa74a604-7a2d-4ce4-ad81-90385336d38f', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Oscillations I', 'This module builds directly on angular momentum and rigid rotation and develops oscillations i. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for oscillations ii.', 4),
  ('e9ab7ace-5946-44c5-acf3-8b89dd4aa0e8', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'aa74a604-7a2d-4ce4-ad81-90385336d38f', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Simple harmonic motion', 'Simple harmonic motion identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations i. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before damping because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('4cf53fab-23aa-4eb9-b323-c10362169f09', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'aa74a604-7a2d-4ce4-ad81-90385336d38f', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Damping', 'Damping identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations i. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After simple harmonic motion, damping supplies what is needed to address forcing.', 1),
  ('d5745983-77d5-4716-aaae-4960b73fe088', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'aa74a604-7a2d-4ce4-ad81-90385336d38f', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Forcing', 'Forcing identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations i. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After damping, forcing supplies what is needed to address resonance.', 2),
  ('bebd3211-9bcc-4558-8e8c-aec8a04d5ba0', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'aa74a604-7a2d-4ce4-ad81-90385336d38f', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Resonance', 'Resonance identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations i. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, resonance carries the completed idea into oscillations ii.', 3),
  ('6716ce54-4f6b-489b-93db-8dbdc23e6b17', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Oscillations II', 'This module builds directly on oscillations i and develops oscillations ii. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for central-force motion.', 5),
  ('f02b004c-2c87-4daa-a76b-7473c8fec23a', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '6716ce54-4f6b-489b-93db-8dbdc23e6b17', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Coupled oscillators', 'Coupled oscillators identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations ii. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before normal modes because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('036a6cad-eb43-44e1-8845-2783f3d41280', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '6716ce54-4f6b-489b-93db-8dbdc23e6b17', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Normal modes', 'Normal modes identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations ii. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After coupled oscillators, normal modes supplies what is needed to address continuum/wave connection.', 1),
  ('7c9423ee-47c3-41e0-8eb5-c63a4a216999', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '6716ce54-4f6b-489b-93db-8dbdc23e6b17', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Continuum/wave connection', 'Continuum/wave connection identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within oscillations ii. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, continuum/wave connection carries the completed idea into central-force motion.', 2),
  ('1d606149-902c-4b60-b580-450665567b12', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Central-force motion', 'This module builds directly on oscillations ii and develops central-force motion. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for noninertial frames.', 6),
  ('a257c508-0203-4021-9b71-42dfa93e5fff', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '1d606149-902c-4b60-b580-450665567b12', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Effective potential', 'Effective potential identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within central-force motion. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before orbits because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('bf6314e9-3564-4d63-be88-85321759071d', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '1d606149-902c-4b60-b580-450665567b12', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Orbits', 'Orbits identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within central-force motion. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After effective potential, orbits supplies what is needed to address kepler problem.', 1),
  ('b91cd564-8e5b-46d9-8daf-ca6e63b91f85', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '1d606149-902c-4b60-b580-450665567b12', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Kepler problem', 'Kepler problem identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within central-force motion. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After orbits, kepler problem supplies what is needed to address scattering.', 2),
  ('bb4e7945-c8b4-422f-a5fc-b941e361f726', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '1d606149-902c-4b60-b580-450665567b12', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Scattering', 'Scattering identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within central-force motion. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, scattering carries the completed idea into noninertial frames.', 3),
  ('60adcbb2-b6f5-4c87-bcb4-4c188f671286', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Noninertial frames', 'This module builds directly on central-force motion and develops noninertial frames. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for calculus of variations.', 7),
  ('d8c1180f-f7d9-4a65-a786-764a0fe306f4', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '60adcbb2-b6f5-4c87-bcb4-4c188f671286', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Rotating coordinates', 'Rotating coordinates identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within noninertial frames. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before coriolis/centrifugal forces because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('22f7294d-a5f4-4b12-843a-1ac965f63e3d', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '60adcbb2-b6f5-4c87-bcb4-4c188f671286', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Coriolis/centrifugal forces', 'Coriolis/centrifugal forces is a governing quantity in noninertial frames, linking local calculations to system-level behavior and offering a consistency check. After rotating coordinates, coriolis/centrifugal forces supplies what is needed to address earth examples.', 1),
  ('9fcdaf87-c49b-4cac-b4e8-7da4d2292218', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '60adcbb2-b6f5-4c87-bcb4-4c188f671286', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Earth examples', 'Earth examples identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within noninertial frames. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, earth examples carries the completed idea into calculus of variations.', 2),
  ('f859b44e-e1a7-49fd-93b8-fdb1ce67bf91', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Calculus of variations', 'This module builds directly on noninertial frames and develops calculus of variations. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for lagrangian mechanics.', 8),
  ('64ad9107-0bcd-4bab-8495-6e5c8cc1bcda', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'f859b44e-e1a7-49fd-93b8-fdb1ce67bf91', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Functionals', 'Functionals identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within calculus of variations. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before euler–lagrange equation because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0);
insert into public.curated_course_nodes (id, course_id, parent_id, node_type, title, description, sort_order)
values
  ('40cf30a2-ff3c-41ff-b819-b122dd22c365', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'f859b44e-e1a7-49fd-93b8-fdb1ce67bf91', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Euler–Lagrange equation', 'Euler–Lagrange equation identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within calculus of variations. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After functionals, euler–lagrange equation supplies what is needed to address brachistochrone.', 1),
  ('b4a773a5-b8ce-4289-a79c-d8d82e972622', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', 'f859b44e-e1a7-49fd-93b8-fdb1ce67bf91', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Brachistochrone', 'Brachistochrone identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within calculus of variations. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, brachistochrone carries the completed idea into lagrangian mechanics.', 2),
  ('0484e1ba-ce5a-4dde-bf96-6023993d61ec', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Lagrangian mechanics', 'This module builds directly on calculus of variations and develops lagrangian mechanics. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for hamiltonian mechanics.', 9),
  ('c2a62b54-85e5-482a-8bfc-b9c37dc5d52e', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '0484e1ba-ce5a-4dde-bf96-6023993d61ec', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Generalized coordinates', 'Generalized coordinates identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within lagrangian mechanics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before constraints because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('8e09a2cf-de41-41a4-839d-e95b865b8114', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '0484e1ba-ce5a-4dde-bf96-6023993d61ec', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Constraints', 'Constraints is a governing quantity in lagrangian mechanics, linking local calculations to system-level behavior and offering a consistency check. After generalized coordinates, constraints supplies what is needed to address symmetries.', 1),
  ('1522cbe3-5139-45a3-8178-d29b289d7b06', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '0484e1ba-ce5a-4dde-bf96-6023993d61ec', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Symmetries', 'Symmetries identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within lagrangian mechanics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After constraints, symmetries supplies what is needed to address noether theorem.', 2),
  ('70481317-2e92-4427-890d-a6fb624f91e2', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '0484e1ba-ce5a-4dde-bf96-6023993d61ec', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Noether theorem', 'Noether theorem provides a formal guarantee or inference rule for lagrangian mechanics, allowing later conclusions to be justified rather than inferred from examples alone. As the final topic in this module, noether theorem carries the completed idea into hamiltonian mechanics.', 3),
  ('928db473-c544-47f2-b3fd-20c93f5dc183', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Hamiltonian mechanics', 'This module builds directly on lagrangian mechanics and develops hamiltonian mechanics. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for nonlinear dynamics.', 10),
  ('f2dde354-0bb2-4ec6-8ec1-1795bbc80cf5', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '928db473-c544-47f2-b3fd-20c93f5dc183', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Canonical equations', 'Canonical equations identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within hamiltonian mechanics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. It appears before phase flow because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('090b2f78-b9fc-4093-8629-5730117b930f', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '928db473-c544-47f2-b3fd-20c93f5dc183', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Phase flow', 'Phase flow identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within hamiltonian mechanics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After canonical equations, phase flow supplies what is needed to address poisson brackets.', 1),
  ('640ab9d4-2686-427a-a95e-5e54538a32ce', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '928db473-c544-47f2-b3fd-20c93f5dc183', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Poisson brackets', 'Poisson brackets identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within hamiltonian mechanics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. As the final topic in this module, poisson brackets carries the completed idea into nonlinear dynamics.', 2),
  ('72505000-1cf0-4a51-b51a-9578a2248f97', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', null, 'topic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Nonlinear dynamics', 'This culminating module draws on hamiltonian mechanics and develops nonlinear dynamics. It belongs last because it requires the earlier tools to be selected, combined, and evaluated rather than used one at a time.', 11),
  ('3c606321-4134-4e81-b187-cd41b1e37a71', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '72505000-1cf0-4a51-b51a-9578a2248f97', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Stability', 'Stability makes the validity limits of nonlinear dynamics explicit, showing when an otherwise correct method or system can become unreliable. It appears before bifurcation because that next topic assumes this starting point.', 0),
  ('c330b0f6-0d24-4a07-8f75-f847518f2a07', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '72505000-1cf0-4a51-b51a-9578a2248f97', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Bifurcation', 'Bifurcation identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within nonlinear dynamics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After stability, bifurcation supplies what is needed to address chaos.', 1),
  ('4d9e5793-9b6a-41b2-ae7b-0fcb54864a7d', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '72505000-1cf0-4a51-b51a-9578a2248f97', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Chaos', 'Chaos identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within nonlinear dynamics. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module''s ideas in later work. After bifurcation, chaos supplies what is needed to address numerical integration.', 2),
  ('76a90cd0-aadc-4b18-88ef-01b44c5fe012', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '72505000-1cf0-4a51-b51a-9578a2248f97', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Numerical integration', 'Numerical integration is an executable part of nonlinear dynamics; its correctness, cost, and failure modes recur in later problems and implementations. After chaos, numerical integration supplies what is needed to address synthesis.', 3),
  ('4d3f5d89-bbf0-4a1f-8daf-989991dce7f4', 'd385f7d0-ad33-4193-b733-c0ea6878f3d2', '72505000-1cf0-4a51-b51a-9578a2248f97', 'subtopic'::public.curated_course_node_type, 'Synthesis', 'Synthesis turns the theory of nonlinear dynamics into a defensible decision and exposes the relevant structure, cost, or performance trade-offs. As the final course topic, synthesis requires ideas from the complete path to be integrated and transferred.', 4);
